   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Emotions + que + subjunctive",
     "texto": [
      "After a feeling the subjunctive is used: **Je suis content que tu sois là** (I'm glad you are here).",
      "The same goes for **triste**, **surpris**, **inquiet** (worried), **heureux** (happy) or **C'est normal que** (it's normal that)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Watch out",
     "texto": [
      "If the subject is the same, there is no «que»: **Je suis content d'être là** (I'm glad to be here)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
